# Kaya's Ghostform returns the enchanted creature after it dies, while the Aura stays in the graveyard (CR 603.6c).
[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Kaya's Ghostform
Shock
Island
Island
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Kaya's Ghostform.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Hand.Kaya's Ghostform.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Shock.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot1.Graveyard = Kaya's Ghostform; Shock
